- semidoc
- cooperate

' Shared Semidoc flow compiler. Only explicitly marked regions are executable.
' Operations are ordinary published Foil laws; values travel as namespace trees.
' Structured metadata stays in typed values rather than a slot per struct field.
' Persistent contracts: imported as pinned artifacts during mount refresh.
+ flow
  + operation
    : ports=row[iota] run={\ axal[myth]}either[iota axal[myth]]
  + binding
    : port=iota value=iota
  + step
    : name=iota origin=safe law=pin[flow/operation] bindings=row[flow/binding]
  + page
    : title=nat body=row[snode] uses=row[iota]
  + source
    : location=str digest=str format=str content=str
  + documentation
    : title=nat body=row[snode]
  + definition
    : source=safe text=str inputs=row[iota] steps=row[flow/step]
      pages=pin[axal[myth]] result=iota
  + event
    : name=iota value=pin[axal[myth]]
  + evaluation
    : result=pin[axal[myth]] trace=row[flow/event]
  + task
    : brief=flow/page evidence=pin[axal[myth]]
  + judgment
    : tasks=pin[axal[myth]]
  + resolution
    : task=pin[flow/task] page=flow/page note=str
  + pending
    : step=iota tasks=pin[axal[myth]] ready=pin[axal[myth]]
